        "text_VCHWyy": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Unlike other cooking companies – we don’t make it our business to tell you what to do. You’re the cook! <em>You decide what tastes best.</em></p><p><strong>What temp is a steak “perfectly done”? </strong></p><p><strong>What recipes take you to your happy place?</strong></p><p><em>It's always up to you</em>. </p><p>These apps are more tools in your set - to guide you to your perfect doneness and to make your recipes easier to find, cook with, and share. Choose the app that fits your cooking style. </p>",
            "width": "fit-content",
            "max_width": "normal",
            "alignment": "left",
