                "text": "<p>One of the best things about cooking with Combustion tools, is that you get <strong>real-time feedback</strong> as you go. </p><p>Having visible information at the ready, watching the graph (don’t laugh, it’s mesmerizing!) teaches you more about heat and how it works than you ever would have imagined. </p><p><strong>Crouton</strong> is also a great learning tool. With <strong>step-by-step cooking guidance</strong>, it’s one of the best ways to wrap your head around new recipes and get it right the first time. </p>",
